    "body": "Check of the `pocket3d_hsm` heavy counts. The step was `cargo xtask gate release --only \"app heavy: pocket3d_hsm\"`, release profile, Windows x86_64.\n\nRun 1, `origin/main` at 6d0381f19: FAIL. The test `the_users_bore_roughs_adaptive_level_by_level_and_verifies_clean` panics at `crates/app/tests/pocket3d_hsm.rs:157`. The counts are (moves, planar, arcs) = (4688, 4660, 1980). The test expects (3158, 3130, 1141).\n\nRun 2, `dc0f23ae2^1` (2e2d40cb3, the commit before PR #3857): FAIL. The test and the counts are the same: (4688, 4660, 1980).\n\nBoth runs give the same counts. Thus PR #3857 did not introduce the change. The change is in an earlier commit. A bisect between the commit that set (3158, 3130, 1141) and 2e2d40cb3 is needed to find it. This check did not run a bisect.\n\nEach run also showed the four known-fail tests as skipped (#1950, #2849). They did not change.\n",
