    "body": "Bisect status (paused for disk space, by the coordinator's order):\n\n- Tested so far: none with a result. The first step was v0.26.0 (fe385c642), the expected good end. Its release build was stopped mid-compile. The log shows `could not compile camcraft-app (lib)`, which is from the stop, not a test result.\n- Remaining range: all of `v0.26.0..2e2d40cb3`, 58 first-parent merges. The good end v0.26.0 is not yet confirmed.\n- Candidate merges that change the pocket planner: 6c164521f (#3790), 7f4915a6d (#3818), ed6f980ef (#3823), c65757d07 (#3837), d210c7c0d (#3855), 1fe369fab (#3872).\n- The worktree `.claude/worktrees/bisect-3886` stays, without `target/`. No build starts again before the \"go\".",
